      "id": "s01",
      "type": "rubric",
      "text": "Discooperit Calicem, genuflectit, accipit Hostiam inter pollicem et indicem manus dexteræ: et tenens sinistra Calicem, cum Hostia signat ter a labio ad labium Calicis, dicens:",
      "narrative": {
        "pl": "Kapłan odsłania kielich, przyklęka, bierze Hostię w prawą rękę, a kielich w lewą, po czym czyni Hostią trzy znaki krzyża od brzegu do brzegu kielicha.",
        "en": "The priest uncovers the chalice, genuflects, takes the Host in his right hand and the chalice in his left, and makes three signs of the cross with the Host from rim to rim of the chalice."
      }
    },
